****************************
Cryptology Vector Provenance
****************************

The files in this directory are generated by ``erbsland-core-tool import-cryptology-vectors`` from pinned upstream files.
The unit tests never download data.
Online imports download only the selected sources. Use ``--source-directory`` for offline imports.
Text SHA-256 digests normalize CRLF and lone CR to LF; all other bytes remain significant.
ZIP archive digests cover the original binary bytes.

