The C2SP Wycheproof and x509-limbo sources and the response files derived from them are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The complete license text is in the repository's ``LICENSE`` file.
Each derived response file retains the upstream file, pinned commit, available vector-source or generator-version
attribution, and a prominent conversion notice.
The pinned Wycheproof revision contains no ``NOTICE`` file.
Distributions that contain these fixtures independently of the source tree must include the repository ``LICENSE`` file
and this provenance document.

